        "chars_per_1k_ink": 27.78
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        248,
        1269,
        1502,
        1389
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "I am issuing the annual call for such legislative proposals as may be recommended by City departments and agencies for submission to the Legislature during the 1959 Session.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2246,
          "min": -1.3388
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 33,
          "mean": -0.0035,
          "min": -0.1129
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 5436,
        "area_px": 150645,
        "density": 0.03608,
        "chars": 173,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 31.82
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        248,
        1427,
        1613,
        1741
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The formulation of a sound legislative program usually requires numerous preliminary conferences and study. The preparation of specific bills to implement such a program requires much analysis and study before a bill is in final form for introduction. It is, therefore, most important that proposed legislation be submitted as soon as possible. This is especially true if a Joint Legislative Committee or a Temporary State Commission has been created to study a particular subject or if the legislation involves State or City funds.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1998,
          "min": -1.4688
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 89,
          "mean": -0.0003,
          "min": -0.0182
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 11540,
        "area_px": 427140,
        "density": 0.02702,
        "chars": 532,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 46.1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        248,
        1778,
        1635,
        1933
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Consistent with my policy of utilizing the City's home rule powers to the fullest extent, I direct that State legislation be recommended only to enact legislative measures which cannot as a matter of law be adopted locally.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.19,
          "min": -1.3244
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 41,
          "mean": -0.0004,
          "min": -0.0068
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 5847,
        "area_px": 213590,
        "density": 0.02737,
        "chars": 223,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 38.14
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        248,
        1972,
        1635,
        2167
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Each proposed bill must be accompanied by a supporting memorandum stating in detail the purpose of the bill and the reason for requesting it. The memorandum should also contain a complete statement of any previous legislative history, and an estimate of any fiscal significance the bill may have.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1555,
          "min": -1.3227
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 51,
          "mean": -0.0001,
